{"id":"1182779246441140224","date":"2019-10-11","url":"https://x.com/kevinweil/status/1182779246441140224","author":"kevinweil","text":"👇","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/davidmarcus/status/1182775730427572224","text":"I would caution against reading the fate of Libra into this update. Of course, it’s not great news in the short term, but in a way it’s liberating. Stay tuned for more very soon. Change of this magnitude is hard. You know you’re on to something when so much pressure builds up."},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20191011221734","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20191011221734/https://twitter.com/kevinweil/status/1182779246441140224","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
